    "preamble": "Mohd. Asif vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 9 August, 2021 Bench: Manoj Misra, Jayant Banerji High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 40 Case :- Writ - C No. - 15212 of 2021 Petitioner :- Mohd. Asif Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Sandeep Kumar Srivastava Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Manoj Misra,J. Hon'ble Jayant Banerji,J.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Sri Sandeep Kumar Srivastava, learned counsel for the petitioner, fairly states that remedy of an appeal against the impugned order is there under Section 72 of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 and therefore he may be permitted to withdraw this petition with liberty to take recourse of the remedy available under the aforesaid Act.",
